		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(700.0, -10.0, 300.0, 110.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 11. One shared **SBERT Embedder** feeds all four exercises. In each Corpus, check that the text feature is `Word` (11D: `Sentence`).*</text>
